    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Are you ready to admire the lotus blossoms among a flurry of butterflies? Give this game a try!**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaxing, casual game suitable for players of all ages. In the game, you will play as a little butterfly, dodging collisions with other butterflies along the way, flying across mountains and through blooming lotus fields, and ultimately reaching the finish line. Just like a real little butterfly, you can enjoy the beautiful scenery on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The overall difficulty of the levels is relatively low, allowing players to appreciate the game's unique art style and music while carefully working through each stage. Of course, some levels are designed to be more challenging, offering opportunities for players to push their limits, overcome obstacles, and experience a sense of personal achievement. In these harder stages, the other butterflies move faster and have larger collision ranges, making them even more difficult to avoid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's playtime depends partly on the player's skill, but it also allows players to open and replay their favorite levels anytime they have a moment to spare, revisiting those cherished animated backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Story Background:**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One morning, a little butterfly wakes up alone in an unfamiliar world of mountains and lotus flowers. On its journey to find its flock, it continuously overcomes dangers and obstacles, gradually discovering and falling in love with the world around it...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Controls:**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click \u2013 Enter game level  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD \u2013 Move  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >J \u2013 Hold to accelerate  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I \u2013 Toggle fullscreen  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O \u2013 Exit fullscreen  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESC \u2013 Quit the game  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope this game brings a bit of joy into your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to share your thoughts and suggestions about the gameplay, art, and music\u2014we'd love to hear from you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Are you ready to admire the lotus blossoms among a flurry of butterflies? Give this game a try!**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaxing, casual game suitable for players of all ages. In the game, you will play as a little butterfly, dodging collisions with other butterflies along the way, flying across mountains and through blooming lotus fields, and ultimately reaching the finish line. Just like a real little butterfly, you can enjoy the beautiful scenery on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The overall difficulty of the levels is relatively low, allowing players to appreciate the game's unique art style and music while carefully working through each stage. Of course, some levels are designed to be more challenging, offering opportunities for players to push their limits, overcome obstacles, and experience a sense of personal achievement. In these harder stages, the other butterflies move faster and have larger collision ranges, making them even more difficult to avoid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's playtime depends partly on the player's skill, but it also allows players to open and replay their favorite levels anytime they have a moment to spare, revisiting those cherished animated backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Story Background:**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One morning, a little butterfly wakes up alone in an unfamiliar world of mountains and lotus flowers. On its journey to find its flock, it continuously overcomes dangers and obstacles, gradually discovering and falling in love with the world around it...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Controls:**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click \u2013 Enter game level  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD \u2013 Move  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >J \u2013 Hold to accelerate  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I \u2013 Toggle fullscreen  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O \u2013 Exit fullscreen  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESC \u2013 Quit the game  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope this game brings a bit of joy into your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to share your thoughts and suggestions about the gameplay, art, and music\u2014we'd love to hear from you!</p>",
